00:58:22.950 --> 00:58:41.070
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia, who is officially our boss, but really, at this point, after all these years, he's more like a co-worker, and he's my friend. And his dad just died this week, and all of our hearts go out to him, and his mom, and his family. We'll resume making fun of him in a week or two.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理层对我们节目的监督由托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生负责，他正式是我们的老板，但实际上，到了这个时候，这么多年过去了，他更像是我的同事，而且是我的朋友。他的父亲这周刚刚去世，我们所有人的心都与他、他的母亲和他的家人同在。我们会在一两周后恢复取笑他的习惯。

00:58:41.070 --> 00:58:56.170
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:56.170 --> 00:59:01.170
